            <abstract>
                <p>Genealogy listing the tribes
                  of the Twelve Apostles and their parents. The witnesses show some variations,
                  <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BNFet64#ms_i6">Paris, Bibliothèque nationale de France, BnF Éthiopien 64: Genealogy of the Twelve Apostles (in ms_i6)</ref> seems to contain an older and shorter version.
                    </p>
